# ============================================================================
# TOURMA - GIT IGNORE CONFIGURATION FOR NETBEANS JAVA WEB PROJECT
# Git chỉ theo dõi Source Code (src/), Web Resources (web/), DDL & Docs.
# Bỏ qua các file cấu hình NetBeans máy cá nhân, Build outputs & Temp files.
# ============================================================================

# 1. NetBeans Project Properties & Machine-Specific Files
nbproject/private/
nbproject/project.properties
nbproject/project.xml
nbproject/

# 2. NetBeans Staging, Build Outputs & Distribution Packages
/build/
/dist/
*.war
*.ear
*.class

# 3. Temporary & OS Specific Files
.netbeans_automatic_build
.netbeans_update_resources
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
